{"2721990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Breath of the Pasture", "steam_appid": 2721990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A heartfelt life-sim about love, land, and the magic of the countryside.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the laughter of a bustling town and the warmth of its kindhearted residents, an old, long-abandoned ranch quietly awaits a new owner. And when you one day ride across the meadows with your friends and pets, may you still remember the simple joy of cuddling a puppy or galloping through the fields on horseback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compose your very own pastoral symphony—<br>Listen to the rain as it falls. Chase the breeze on sunny days. Watch crops reach for the sky. Let your cows and sheep rest in peace. Fall in love. Grow a farm. That is the <strong>Breath of the Pasture</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're so happy you’ve found your way here. If you’re a fan of games like <i>story of the seasons </i>or <i>Stardew Valley</i>, please—don’t miss this. Trust us: we made this for you. And we promise, you won’t be disappointed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌾 Welcome to the world of <i>Breath of the Pasture</i>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you can do anything you dream of:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚜 <strong>Farming at scale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with <strong>1,350 plots</strong> of arable land—vast and full of potential. This is a true farming haven!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/0aa103383e0030142869699707916b53.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/0aa103383e0030142869699707916b53.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/0aa103383e0030142869699707916b53.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/b90d295836e7be596f880347495bed39.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/b90d295836e7be596f880347495bed39.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/b90d295836e7be596f880347495bed39.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌱 <strong>Seasonal changes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes three rich seasons—<strong>spring</strong>, <strong>summer</strong>, and <strong>autumn</strong>—each with exclusive wild forage and seasonal crops. (Winter was too tough to finish, sorry! 😅)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/be4a9cb688b35dce4fd2aafaa8376e62.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/be4a9cb688b35dce4fd2aafaa8376e62.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/be4a9cb688b35dce4fd2aafaa8376e62.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🥕 <strong>Crops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow 24 different crops, each with distinct stages and visuals. But be careful—crops only grow in specific seasons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/d1d7f4d8324f91ca4f5ef8ce25b90c79.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/d1d7f4d8324f91ca4f5ef8ce25b90c79.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/d1d7f4d8324f91ca4f5ef8ce25b90c79.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧚‍♀️ <strong>Helpers: Spirits &amp; Robots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call upon cheerful spirits to water and harvest, or deploy trusty robots for planting and care. (We really hope you’ll love them as much as we do!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/32b88763fc0dea4542a55179a854fc53.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/32b88763fc0dea4542a55179a854fc53.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/32b88763fc0dea4542a55179a854fc53.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾 <strong>Animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise pets like dogs and horses, or farm animals like cows, sheep, and chickens. You can even <strong>adopt wild animals</strong> like foxes or bunnies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/3195a13e9dc9db3ee849d84d37806ec0.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/3195a13e9dc9db3ee849d84d37806ec0.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/3195a13e9dc9db3ee849d84d37806ec0.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/50ce3ba63bfade96c765577977f8f59a.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/50ce3ba63bfade96c765577977f8f59a.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/50ce3ba63bfade96c765577977f8f59a.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎣 <strong>Fishing &amp; Bug Catching</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch <strong>nearly 200 species of fish and aquatic life</strong>, plus <strong>50+ unique butterflies</strong>! Each species comes with an ecological background—learn where and how to find them through natural clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/bf54504df73b48e598aa3435c8fd04ab.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/bf54504df73b48e598aa3435c8fd04ab.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/bf54504df73b48e598aa3435c8fd04ab.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/65d8362aea795ffc55e11ec2d215eb71.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/65d8362aea795ffc55e11ec2d215eb71.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/65d8362aea795ffc55e11ec2d215eb71.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍳 <strong>Cooking System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment freely with ingredients and cookware. The game features <strong>over 600 dishes</strong> to discover and create!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/abe267b29a7b8cdda629d62dfdd75459.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/abe267b29a7b8cdda629d62dfdd75459.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/abe267b29a7b8cdda629d62dfdd75459.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⛏️ <strong>Mines &amp; Treasures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig up ores and precious gems! Use your hoe to excavate and hammer to smash rocks. Wealth lies beneath!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/f5b4c890264fa58982c63c43f5b33254.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/f5b4c890264fa58982c63c43f5b33254.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/f5b4c890264fa58982c63c43f5b33254.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💞 <strong>Romance &amp; Marriage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>10 romance candidates</strong>, with <strong>inclusive gender options</strong> for all players. Every townsperson also has unique friendship storylines.<br>(<i>P.S. Reverse proposals are coming! We're working hard on it!</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/ae3af927e04570866e514922d5f5e83a.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/ae3af927e04570866e514922d5f5e83a.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/ae3af927e04570866e514922d5f5e83a.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎁 <strong>Gifts &amp; Birthdays</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has their favorite things. Build friendships, and villagers will even celebrate <strong>your birthday</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/95a84d48f40344f939c8e1c2f3f0143c.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/95a84d48f40344f939c8e1c2f3f0143c.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/95a84d48f40344f939c8e1c2f3f0143c.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 <strong>Local Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re working toward <strong>split-screen two-player mode</strong>—pending tech success, it’s coming!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👒 <strong>Fashion &amp; Riding Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to limited production, we’re focusing on <strong>hats and rideable mounts</strong>. But dozens of options await, including <strong>DIY hat design tools</strong> for your personal touch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/7872df0f5e1c981809a31f9b80dc8ca0.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/7872df0f5e1c981809a31f9b80dc8ca0.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/7872df0f5e1c981809a31f9b80dc8ca0.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/4723bb71443eef51e46d0f9799ddeaf5.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/4723bb71443eef51e46d0f9799ddeaf5.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/4723bb71443eef51e46d0f9799ddeaf5.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏡 <strong>Decorating</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your farm and town with dozens of decorations. Make your world truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/9a4ef7405381383df8477d226d3e38c0.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/9a4ef7405381383df8477d226d3e38c0.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/9a4ef7405381383df8477d226d3e38c0.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌐 <strong>Online Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>4 players</strong> can play together! Help each other water, harvest, and grow together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📺 <strong>Community Sharing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a beginner is tough. Our <strong>Time Gift</strong> system allows players to receive gifts from others through the in-game TV! Someday, you might send your own kindness to someone else too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there’s still so much more waiting for you to discover—<br><strong>Let the land surprise you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/6a993f29875fcf52d33f47ec253dfd03.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/6a993f29875fcf52d33f47ec253dfd03.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/6a993f29875fcf52d33f47ec253dfd03.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💬 A few heartfelt words...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We wish we could have made even more. The Steam version will be <strong>a unique build</strong>, with <strong>HD textures</strong>, <strong>official mod support</strong>, and even a <strong>DIY story editor</strong>. So many dreams we want to realize—we’ll do our best to finish them by mid-2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to every single player who supports us. You’re the reason this game exists.<br>Thank you to our amazing developer team—you made magic.<br>And lastly... thank you to our investors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please, above all—<br><strong>Be happy.</strong><br>We hope this game brings you joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>                                                                                — From the developer of <i>Breath of the Pasture</i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A heartfelt life-sim about love, land, and the magic of the countryside.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the laughter of a bustling town and the warmth of its kindhearted residents, an old, long-abandoned ranch quietly awaits a new owner. And when you one day ride across the meadows with your friends and pets, may you still remember the simple joy of cuddling a puppy or galloping through the fields on horseback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compose your very own pastoral symphony—<br>Listen to the rain as it falls. Chase the breeze on sunny days. Watch crops reach for the sky. Let your cows and sheep rest in peace. Fall in love. Grow a farm. That is the <strong>Breath of the Pasture</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're so happy you’ve found your way here. If you’re a fan of games like <i>story of the seasons </i>or <i>Stardew Valley</i>, please—don’t miss this. Trust us: we made this for you. And we promise, you won’t be disappointed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌾 Welcome to the world of <i>Breath of the Pasture</i>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you can do anything you dream of:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚜 <strong>Farming at scale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with <strong>1,350 plots</strong> of arable land—vast and full of potential. This is a true farming haven!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/0aa103383e0030142869699707916b53.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/0aa103383e0030142869699707916b53.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/0aa103383e0030142869699707916b53.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/b90d295836e7be596f880347495bed39.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/b90d295836e7be596f880347495bed39.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/b90d295836e7be596f880347495bed39.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌱 <strong>Seasonal changes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes three rich seasons—<strong>spring</strong>, <strong>summer</strong>, and <strong>autumn</strong>—each with exclusive wild forage and seasonal crops. (Winter was too tough to finish, sorry! 😅)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/be4a9cb688b35dce4fd2aafaa8376e62.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/be4a9cb688b35dce4fd2aafaa8376e62.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/be4a9cb688b35dce4fd2aafaa8376e62.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🥕 <strong>Crops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow 24 different crops, each with distinct stages and visuals. But be careful—crops only grow in specific seasons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/d1d7f4d8324f91ca4f5ef8ce25b90c79.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/d1d7f4d8324f91ca4f5ef8ce25b90c79.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/d1d7f4d8324f91ca4f5ef8ce25b90c79.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧚‍♀️ <strong>Helpers: Spirits &amp; Robots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call upon cheerful spirits to water and harvest, or deploy trusty robots for planting and care. (We really hope you’ll love them as much as we do!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/32b88763fc0dea4542a55179a854fc53.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/32b88763fc0dea4542a55179a854fc53.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/32b88763fc0dea4542a55179a854fc53.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾 <strong>Animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise pets like dogs and horses, or farm animals like cows, sheep, and chickens. You can even <strong>adopt wild animals</strong> like foxes or bunnies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/3195a13e9dc9db3ee849d84d37806ec0.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/3195a13e9dc9db3ee849d84d37806ec0.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/3195a13e9dc9db3ee849d84d37806ec0.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/50ce3ba63bfade96c765577977f8f59a.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/50ce3ba63bfade96c765577977f8f59a.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/50ce3ba63bfade96c765577977f8f59a.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎣 <strong>Fishing &amp; Bug Catching</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch <strong>nearly 200 species of fish and aquatic life</strong>, plus <strong>50+ unique butterflies</strong>! Each species comes with an ecological background—learn where and how to find them through natural clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/bf54504df73b48e598aa3435c8fd04ab.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/bf54504df73b48e598aa3435c8fd04ab.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/bf54504df73b48e598aa3435c8fd04ab.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/65d8362aea795ffc55e11ec2d215eb71.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/65d8362aea795ffc55e11ec2d215eb71.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/65d8362aea795ffc55e11ec2d215eb71.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍳 <strong>Cooking System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment freely with ingredients and cookware. The game features <strong>over 600 dishes</strong> to discover and create!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/abe267b29a7b8cdda629d62dfdd75459.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/abe267b29a7b8cdda629d62dfdd75459.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/abe267b29a7b8cdda629d62dfdd75459.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⛏️ <strong>Mines &amp; Treasures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig up ores and precious gems! Use your hoe to excavate and hammer to smash rocks. Wealth lies beneath!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/f5b4c890264fa58982c63c43f5b33254.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/f5b4c890264fa58982c63c43f5b33254.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/f5b4c890264fa58982c63c43f5b33254.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💞 <strong>Romance &amp; Marriage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>10 romance candidates</strong>, with <strong>inclusive gender options</strong> for all players. Every townsperson also has unique friendship storylines.<br>(<i>P.S. Reverse proposals are coming! We're working hard on it!</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/ae3af927e04570866e514922d5f5e83a.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/ae3af927e04570866e514922d5f5e83a.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/ae3af927e04570866e514922d5f5e83a.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎁 <strong>Gifts &amp; Birthdays</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has their favorite things. Build friendships, and villagers will even celebrate <strong>your birthday</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/95a84d48f40344f939c8e1c2f3f0143c.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/95a84d48f40344f939c8e1c2f3f0143c.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/95a84d48f40344f939c8e1c2f3f0143c.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 <strong>Local Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re working toward <strong>split-screen two-player mode</strong>—pending tech success, it’s coming!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👒 <strong>Fashion &amp; Riding Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to limited production, we’re focusing on <strong>hats and rideable mounts</strong>. But dozens of options await, including <strong>DIY hat design tools</strong> for your personal touch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/7872df0f5e1c981809a31f9b80dc8ca0.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/7872df0f5e1c981809a31f9b80dc8ca0.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/7872df0f5e1c981809a31f9b80dc8ca0.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/4723bb71443eef51e46d0f9799ddeaf5.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/4723bb71443eef51e46d0f9799ddeaf5.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/4723bb71443eef51e46d0f9799ddeaf5.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏡 <strong>Decorating</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your farm and town with dozens of decorations. Make your world truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/9a4ef7405381383df8477d226d3e38c0.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/9a4ef7405381383df8477d226d3e38c0.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/9a4ef7405381383df8477d226d3e38c0.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌐 <strong>Online Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>4 players</strong> can play together! Help each other water, harvest, and grow together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📺 <strong>Community Sharing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a beginner is tough. Our <strong>Time Gift</strong> system allows players to receive gifts from others through the in-game TV! Someday, you might send your own kindness to someone else too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there’s still so much more waiting for you to discover—<br><strong>Let the land surprise you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/6a993f29875fcf52d33f47ec253dfd03.poster.avif?t=1778395578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/6a993f29875fcf52d33f47ec253dfd03.webm?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/extras/6a993f29875fcf52d33f47ec253dfd03.mp4?t=1778395578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💬 A few heartfelt words...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We wish we could have made even more. The Steam version will be <strong>a unique build</strong>, with <strong>HD textures</strong>, <strong>official mod support</strong>, and even a <strong>DIY story editor</strong>. So many dreams we want to realize—we’ll do our best to finish them by mid-2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to every single player who supports us. You’re the reason this game exists.<br>Thank you to our amazing developer team—you made magic.<br>And lastly... thank you to our investors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please, above all—<br><strong>Be happy.</strong><br>We hope this game brings you joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>                                                                                — From the developer of <i>Breath of the Pasture</i></strong></p>", "short_description": "A heartfelt life-sim about love, land, and the magic of the countryside. Compose your very own pastoral symphony— Listen to the rain as it falls. Chase the breeze on sunny days. Watch crops reach for the sky. Let your cows and sheep rest in peace. Fall in love. Grow a farm. That is THE GAME!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/0db1e5ff4aa33c35460bbbf690dfb2af50b537dd/header.jpg?t=1778395578", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/6143be0c586a5e5b59503a3c95dfb0e0d6074309/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778395578", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721990/6143be0c586a5e5b59503a3c95dfb0e0d6074309/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778395578", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Vista or Greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory, shader model 3.0+<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2048 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended